OL,3,GNEWSADrug-dealing footballer's hearing
OL,4,Aadjourned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA footballer who bragged on Instagram
OL,7,Fabout his drug dealing has been given
OL,8,Fmore time to disclose information about
OL,9,Fhis finances.
OL,11,FThierry Nevers, 24, who previously
OL,12,Fplayed for West Ham, Newport County and
OL,13,FBradford City, was jailed for three
OL,14,Fyears last year after pleading guilty
OL,15,Fto conspiracy to supply Class A drugs.
OL,17,FFollowing the convictions, a Proceeds
OL,18,Fof Crime Act investigation (POCA) was
OL,19,Fordered to work out how much money he
OL,20,Fmade from criminal activity and to
OL,21,Frecover any available assets.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
