OL,3,GNEWSADrug-dealing footballer's hearing
OL,4,Aadjourned
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut during a hearing at Lincoln Crown
OL,7,FCourt, the court heard more information
OL,8,Fwas needed from Nevers. His case has
OL,9,Fbeen adjourned until 26 October.
